  ('ac7ef6de-cec9-5a82-9eb3-27f3f637b5a6', '498232a5-7ed2-5cb1-b690-3cf0477ee178', 'Implementation methods', 'The four methods of introducing a new system — direct, parallel, pilot and phased — and their advantages and disadvantages.', 'published', now()),
