  ('5ef7d358-dea2-5ce8-ad1c-6419eadaf322', 'ea65b685-d0c0-5aa8-bb8d-d6bb01f68d36', 'Complete bubble loop headers', 'Complete the missing parts of this ascending bubble sort for `Values[1:N]`.

